le Потусторонний affixes will grant additional Blessing effects, which vary depending on the different Потусторонний affixes and the number of affixes. \nWhen replacing equipment, reshaped affixes are <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped).",
